s any status? Yes no status filter, any refund. Use refunds table. All orders includes no status. Good.\n\nNo code fence. Final SQL."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":2910,"completion_tokens":484,"total_tokens":3394,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1792},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":421},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1792,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":1118},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}